[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25742.99, "timestamp": "07:09:02", "text": "，RX。 「我大學時也像他那樣。想像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25745.43, "timestamp": "07:09:05", "text": "你會從其他孩子那裡聽到的這些故事。是的。 等等，你身上還有紗布疤痕嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25746.788, "timestamp": "07:09:06", "text": "？是的，我身上有疤痕。這就是為什麼我不太喜歡露出我的手之類的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25748.548, "timestamp": "07:09:08", "text": "身上有很多疤痕。不只是那件事，我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 25767.559, "timestamp": "07:09:27", "author": "@swordfish_0219", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kyKEfV4DpM3RY4S4kitmAih-V8pz1JPa4McVrz_xjPFpsG=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "bhai usko ration card bolte hai"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25773.27, "timestamp": "07:09:33", "text": "還得經歷很多手術之類的。所以，我身上留下了很多傷的原因。  是的。太多了。但這並非自我引起的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25774.948, "timestamp": "07:09:34", "text": "。  是的。可能不是，因為它們的眼睛很小。好的。珊瑚。好的。美好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25787.31, "timestamp": "07:09:47", "text": "這不是小腦袋的問題。好的。它的尺寸屬於"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25791.35, "timestamp": "07:09:51", "text": "中等大小。讓我們看看在光線更充足的情況下接下來會發生什麼。對"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25793.67, "timestamp": "07:09:53", "text": "，畫畫。我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 25795.43, "timestamp": "07:09:55", "author": "@swordfish_0219", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kyKEfV4DpM3RY4S4kitmAih-V8pz1JPa4McVrz_xjPFpsG=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "BPL (below poverty line) families have access to grains and rice at 1rs and 2rs"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25799.59, "timestamp": "07:09:59", "text": "確實畫了很多畫，但是，呃，我當時很自嘲。呃，我只是憑感覺隨便看看。  繪畫。  不。好的。這"}]